# Environment Configuration

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and update with your Azure and blockchain credentials.

## Backend Environment Variables

```env
# Server Configuration
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=5000
LOG_LEVEL=info

# Azure Credentials
AZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=your_subscription_id
AZURE_TENANT_ID=your_tenant_id
AZURE_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret

# Azure Cognitive Services
AZURE_VISION_ENDPOINT=https://your-region.api.cognitive.microsoft.com/
AZURE_VISION_KEY=your_vision_key
AZURE_LANGUAGE_ENDPOINT=https://your-region.api.cognitive.microsoft.com/
AZURE_LANGUAGE_KEY=your_language_key
AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource.openai.azure.com/
AZURE_OPENAI_KEY=your_openai_key
AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT=your_deployment_name

# Azure Storage
AZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_NAME=your_storage_account
AZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_KEY=your_storage_key
AZURE_STORAGE_CONTAINER=documents

# Database
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DB_NAME=school_identity_vault
DB_USER=postgres
DB_PASSWORD=your_password

# Blockchain
BLOCKCHAIN_RPC_URL=http://localhost:8545
CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x...
BLOCKCHAIN_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...
BLOCKCHAIN_NETWORK=development

# JWT Authentication
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_key
JWT_EXPIRATION=24h

# CORS
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000

# Logging
LOG_FORMAT=json
LOG_DIRECTORY=./logs
```

## Frontend Environment Variables

```env
# .env (Frontend)
REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
REACT_APP_ML_ENGINE_URL=http://localhost:8000
REACT_APP_BLOCKCHAIN_RPC_URL=http://localhost:8545
REACT_APP_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x...
```

## ML Engine Environment Variables

```env
# ml-engine/.env
AZURE_VISION_KEY=your_vision_key
AZURE_VISION_ENDPOINT=https://your-region.api.cognitive.microsoft.com/
AZURE_OPENAI_KEY=your_openai_key
AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource.openai.azure.com/
AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT=your_deployment_name

LOG_LEVEL=INFO
ML_ENGINE_PORT=8000
```

## Blockchain Environment Variables

```env
# blockchain/.env
BLOCKCHAIN_RPC_URL=http://localhost:8545
PRIVATE_KEY=0x...
GAS_LIMIT=8000000
GAS_PRICE=1000000000
NETWORK_ID=1337
```
